# Fins de ligne : LF dans git et sur le disque, quel que soit core.autocrlf de la machine
# (recette du 29/09, appliquee par l instance infrastructure le 2026-10-06).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.odt binary
*.ods binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.stl binary
*.step binary
*.stp binary
*.dwg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# --- regles existantes, conservees ---
# Tauri-generated capability schemas — checked in for IDE/review visibility.
# Pin to LF so Windows checkouts don't perpetually show them as "modified"
# under core.autocrlf=true.
crates/sovereign-app/gen/schemas/*.json text eol=lf
